# Copy to .env.local for development. .env*.local is gitignored — do not commit it.

# Where the FastAPI backend answers.
#
# LEAVE IT BLANK to run the portal exactly as it does today: every store reads
# and writes localStorage, no request leaves the browser, and the demo works on
# a laptop with no backend running. `apiConfigured()` in lib/api/config.ts is
# what reads this, and every migrated store falls back when it is empty.
#
# Set it to point the portal at a real backend:
#   local dev    http://localhost:8000
#   production   https://api.certrace.co
#
# Whatever value goes here must also appear in the backend's
# CERTRACE_CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS, or the browser blocks the response.
#
# This value is also what puts the backend's origin into the Content-Security-
# Policy (middleware.ts, and scripts/build-csp-headers.mjs for the prerendered
# pages). Change it here and both follow; hardcode the origin in either of
# those and they drift apart the next time this moves.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=
